@PAD: aep-kernel-types-registration-v1
@GCDE: gaplune.policy.v1
schema_id: gaplune.aep.component-registration.v1
format: gaplune
json_prohibited: true
id: aep-kernel-types
version: 2.8.6
kind: library
path: AEP-Components/kernel-types/
ticket: kernel type set
requires: serde serde_json sha2
capability: kernel.public-type-set
note: The one public kernel type set. Envelope, AdmitResult, DenyReport, ClosedWall, Pulse, agent permission and process-sealed are defined here once and every other crate re-exports them.
